  <p id="c-hanshu-064-luchui-shouwang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-hanshu-064-luchui-shouwang:p001:m0000" ref="w6i_zk4_qdx">吾丘壽王</persName>字<persName id="c-hanshu-064-luchui-shouwang:p001:m0005" ref="w6i_zk4_qdx">子贛</persName>，趙人也。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-064-luchui-shouwang:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-hanshu-064-luchui-shouwang:p002:m0000" ref="w6i_zk4_qdx">壽王</persName>獨曰非周鼎。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-064-luchui-shouwang:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">是日，賜<persName id="c-hanshu-064-luchui-shouwang:p003:m0004" ref="w6i_zk4_qdx">壽王</persName>黃金十斤。</p>
